Package: asharechips
Title: Estimate Holding Cost Distributions for Chinese Equities
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "ZHAORUIHONG", email = "3142115360@qq.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates holding-cost distributions of mainland Chinese
    A-share equities from daily price, volume, amount and turnover data.
    Provides offline preparation of 'Tushare' tables, exponential or linear
    turnover replacement, optional adjustment factors and initial cost
    distributions, weighted cost summaries and diagnostic records. The
    explicitly documented models support reproducible research into cost
    concentration and sensitivity to modelling assumptions.
